cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalisation, please cite it as below."
title: "A canonical normal form theorem for the type theory of regular categories in Agda"
abstract: >-
  Two complete Agda formalisations of the canonical normal form theorem for
  T_reg, the type theory of regular categories in Maietti's modular
  correspondence: a Tait-style logical-relations proof in which the
  computability predicate is a recursive function on type structure
  (src/Recursive/, 16 modules, all --safe, no postulates, no TERMINATING
  pragmas, no holes), and an inductive-family encoding of the same predicate
  that documents where that approach breaks down (src/Inductive/).
type: software
authors:
